    "note": {
      "duplicates": "A few terms are described twice in the graph under different identifiers, among them six hazard statements and thirty application comments. They are folded into one term, and filtering on it finds the products of both identifiers.",
      "effects": "The full, partial and side effect properties refine ppp:pest. A pest therefore appears under both properties and is shown only once.",
      "inheritance": "Sale permissions and parallel imports carry no indications of their own; they take on those of their reference product. Search and query account for this inheritance.",
